{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bulbo's Belief System</strong> is a puzzle-platformer where knowledge is both a tool and an obstacle. Bulbo believes everything he's told\u2014learning allows him to see, move, and interact, but forgetting is just as important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erase walls from existence, ignore gravity to walk across gaps, and manage conflicting beliefs to solve mind-bending challenges. Experiment with what Bulbo knows (or doesn't) to navigate a world where perception shapes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you control what Bulbo learns and unlearns to reach the goal?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bulbo learning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549280/extras/Walking.gif?t=1749496502\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bulbo learning the concept of gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549280/extras/Gravity.gif?t=1749496502\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549280?t=1749496502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549280?t=1749496502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549280/814656fa00e8bd63511541a3cef5f0611b409be1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749496502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549280/814656fa00e8bd63511541a3cef5f0611b409be1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749496502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3773470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bulbo's Belief System</strong> is a puzzle-platformer